    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>An iridescent swirl of many colors shimmers in the central jewel of this butterfly-shaped brooch.</p><p>The brooch has 3 charges and regains all expended charges daily at dawn. As a Reaction when a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself hits a target with an attack roll and deals damage, you can expend 1 charge to change one damage type of that attack to Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Poison, or Thunder.</p>",
